invariant: INV-10
file: record.c
catches: diff
builds: bin/diff
reason: truncating the sequence number to 32 bits makes the nonce
  repeat after 2^32 records under one key

--- old
        nonce[AEAD_NONCE - 1 - i] ^= (uint8_t)(d->seq >> (8 * i));
--- new
        nonce[AEAD_NONCE - 1 - i] ^= (uint8_t)((uint32_t)d->seq >> (8 * i));
